ter, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes! Team up with your friends against AI or choose to fight in PvP!\n\n**Build your mage:** Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build. \n\n**Harness the elements:** Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks. \n\n**Grow in Power:** Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.\n\n**Choose Your Battle Mode:** Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.", "short_description": "Crystal Conquest is a free-to-play VR game where you control the elements and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/s/MYSTIC-INTERACTIVE-PRIVACY-POLICY.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Mystic Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/KV9f2dwTdY", "website_url": "https://www.crystalconquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "25649479581303286"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1566552014526318"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1765526400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27526406190277273", "version": "1.0.12"}, "id": "25740082985581976", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27526406190277273"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "1.0.12 Hotfix 1\n- Fixed a Conquest match error which could degrade performance and spawn random spell effects\n- Fixed a UI error which could occur at the end of a match", "created_date": 1780789282, "id": "27526406190277273", "version": "1.0.12", "version_code": 49, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27526406190277273"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1780118747, "id": "27421089074142319", "version": "1.0.12", "version_code": 48, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27526406190277273"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "Patch 1.0.12 Notes\n\nNew Features:\n- Added a crouch button setting\n\nBalancing Changes:\nGeomancer\n- Reduced movement speed\n- Slightly reduced spell power\n- Reduced the Daze effect duration and reduced it further if you hit too quickly with your hammer\n- Reduced the throwing damage of the Geomancer's weapons slightly\nPyromancer\n- Increased fireball mana cost and cooldown slightly\n- Reduced fireball splash damage and size scaling slightly\nMonk\n- Increased movement speed\n- Added a 3 second Daze to the Ki Blast ability and reduced the Daze duration from a power punch to 5 seconds\nIllusionist\n- Increased dagger spell power\n- Reduced cooldown of Shadow Step to 15 seconds\nHydromancer\n- Reduced the health of Kaelar's Prison and ensured that certain spells like Barrage and Leeching Link are blocked by it\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements:\n- Improved win and loss tracking, including when a player leaves a match early (this counts as a loss unless you are the only player remaining)\n- Fixed a bug which could stop projectiles from working in Conquest\n- Greatly extended the distance that your hand can be from the bow string before you let go of it\n- Added a limit to the number of spell effects which can spawn at once\n- Prevented random spell effects from getting stuck to your hand\n- Fixed some tutorial issues with melee spells\n- Fixed a bug where players could fall through the terrain repeatedly after completing a match\n- Hid effects on certain weapons while holstered\n- Ensured that weapon effects and charging effects are hidden while invisible\n- Prevented death after a match ends", "created_date": 1780094697, "id": "27417102557874304", "version": "1.0.12", "version_code": 47, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27526406190277273"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1780090005, "id": "27416326417951918", "version": "1.0.12", "version_code": 46, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27526406190277273"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "Patch 1.0.11 Hotfix 2\n- Fixed issues with casting the wrong spell while using the Transmute ability\n- Fixed an issue which allowed players to extend the Dragon's Breath duration indefinitely", "created_date": 1778965452, "id": "27255560764028485", "version": "1.0.11", "version_code": 45, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "bi